        <p class="hero-description" data-ps="src/pages/practice-area/dexter-assault-charges.astro:ufpv6u">Attorney Joseph A. Simon Named a 2020 Top Ten Criminal Defense Attorney in the State of Michigan by Leading Lawyers Magazine, Following A Peer Review Survey.</p>
